        // the HexaVal tag (the lo eightbyte = x0 of the x0:x1 pair) and box it
        // as an int, INLINE (no runtime call). Lets `.hexa` discriminate tags
        // natively (hexa_type_of/eq/truthy port → Z2c dispatch core) instead of
