        // const, per self/rt/syscall.hexa's convention (__TARGET_OS__ == 1 ⇒
        // darwin, 0 ⇒ linux). This arm64 backend serves BOTH platforms — the
        // value is target-selected: 1 for arm64-apple-darwin, 0 for the ELF
        // arm64-linux-gnu triple. Baking darwin (1) on linux made the seed
        // mis-route mmap/munmap via the BSD svc #0x80 / x16 path → bad arena
