        // with NO `bl` (non-circular leaf, like `__hx_tag`). Both args are
        // int-boxed HexaVals, so the WANTED word is each arg's PAYLOAD (hi = x1/x3
        // of the x0:x1 / x2:x3 pairs). Lets a raw payload word loaded from an array
        // slot be re-stamped with its real element tag WITHOUT going through
