        // intended tag). `_hv_load` clobbers its lo/hi pair as scratch, so arg0 and
        // arg1 are loaded into DISJOINT pairs (x0:x1 then x2:x3); the tag survives
        // in x1, the payload in x3. Then move both into the result {x0=tag, x1=pl}.
