        // (__hx_payload_lt/gt/le/ge) — `cmp x1,x3; cset x0,<cond>` → bool, INLINE.
        // Unblocks the native dispatch core's hexa_cmp_lt/gt/le/ge int leaves.
        // UNSIGNED variants (__hx_payload_ult/ule) use the aarch64 lo/ls cond codes
        // (CF/unsigned), for the fdlibm fmod raw 64-bit bit-word magnitude compares
        // where the high bit is data, not a sign. Mirror of x86_64 setb/setbe.
