        // int len; int cap;}` — `len` is a 32-bit `int` at byte offset 8
        // (NOT int64 — runtime.h's int64 decl is stale). A 32-bit `ldr w1`
        // zero-extends it cleanly; a 64-bit load would fold `cap` into the
        // high word ((cap<<32)|len). Box int. First struct-field-load leaf.
