        // syscall result. The aarch64 syscall ABI is OS-specific:
        //   macOS/XNU : syscall number in x16, trap `svc #0x80`, result x0.
        //   Linux     : syscall number in x8,  trap `svc #0`,    result x0.
        // The seed must match the target kernel — baking the XNU form on
        // linux-arm64 routed mmap via the wrong trap → bad arena base → SIGSEGV
