        // frozen darwin seed. Linux's number register IS x8, which the _hv_load
        // payload scratch and the arg-fill would clobber; so on linux the
        // number is parked in x15 (callee-clobber, ∉ {x0..x5}) until AFTER the
        // fill, then landed in x8 immediately before the trap.
