        // outptr)` — the dual-return sibling of __hx_syscall6 for the darwin BSD
        // 2nd-return-register syscalls pipe(2)/fork(2). It mirrors the __hx_syscall6
        // arg-stage/fill/trap above EXACTLY, then captures BOTH return registers
