        // global via GOT), the symbol `slot_<id>` is DEFINED-here, so its address is
        // built with the LOCAL `adrp x1, slot_<id>@PAGE` + `add x1, x1, slot_<id>@PAGEOFF`
        // pair (NOT @GOTPAGE) — the exact PIE local-symbol form _arm64_op_resolve emits
        // for module globals `g<id>` and cstrings. Both args MUST be compile-time
        // `const_int` literals (deterministic symbol name + fixed BSS size); the slot is
        // recorded ONCE per distinct slot_id into _arm64_static_slots, which
        // codegen_arm64_darwin appends to LModule.globals → emit/asm defines a
        // `.zero size_bytes` buffer. Frozen-safe (151c52c8) — an ordinary identifier-call,
        // no new parser keyword/@attr. The reference label is `slot_<id>` (darwin
        // _fmt_label rewrites to `_slot_<id>`; the data symbol is recorded WITH that
        // platform prefix so def==ref).
