        // `rotab_<id>` (which _fmt_label prefixes to `_rotab_<id>` on darwin, bare on
        // ELF — same spelling discipline as __hx_static_slot's refsym). x0 = TAG_INT
        // (0), x1 = &table; callers read cells via __hx_ptr_load64. This is the
        // table-driven libm mechanism (musl exp __exp_data.tab[256]); frozen-safe
